    "ios_s4_title": "Developer Mode & Missing Fix",
    "ios_s4_desc": "To run sideloaded developer apps on iOS 16+, Apple requires Developer Mode.<br />1. Open <strong>Settings → Privacy & Security</strong>.<br />2. Scroll to the bottom and tap <strong>Developer Mode</strong> → toggle <strong>ON</strong>.<br />3. Restart your iPhone when prompted, then confirm with your passcode.",
